// The Vanishing of Skie Silvershield moves Eldoth to the Friendly Arm Inn the first time you
// enter the Coast Way or the inn. Mark that move as done, so he stays at the Red Sheaf; the
// Vanishing's own dialogue and quest still work there.

IF
	Global("L#SSMoveEldothNow","GLOBAL",0)
THEN
	RESPONSE #100
		SetGlobal("L#SSMoveEldothNow","GLOBAL",3)
END
